# 使用 local 环境。先按 auth.http 注册/登录用户，并按 README 准备管理员。
# 必填下方visitDate为用户已确认预约的就诊日期，并填写真实医生档案ID、预约ID。
# 普通启动按预约快照在[开始前30分钟,结束)接受签到；完整跨日验收使用 scripts/compose_acceptance.py。
@doctorId = 1
@appointmentId = 1
@visitDate =
@sessionType = MORNING_FIRST
@adminAccessToken = replace-with-admin-token
@userAccessToken = replace-with-appointment-owner-token

### 注册医生待关联账号（只执行一次）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"doctor@example.com","password":"password123"}

> {% client.global.set("doctorUserId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 管理员首次绑定医生账号，同时授予 DOCTOR；重复绑定返回 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/doctors/{{doctorId}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":"{{doctorUserId}}"}

### 医生授权后重新登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"doctor@example.com","password":"password123"}

> {% client.global.set("doctorAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 用户全部预约，默认 DESC；可改 ASC
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/my?order=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### 用户原预约详情，已确认预约增加 visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### 用户窗口内签到，无请求体；详情/列表visit返回checkInOpensAt/checkInClosesAt
# 例如08:00–10:00：07:30开放、10:00整截止。过早4503，截止4504，重复4502。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

### 医生默认今天的四场概览
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### 指定日期四场概览，空场补零
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor/sessions?date={{visitDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### 全部已确认人员，固定按就诊序号升序
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor/appointments?date={{visitDate}}&sessionType={{sessionType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### 医生查看详情，四种就诊进度均可查看，证件脱敏
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### 候诊中开始接诊，无请求体
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/start-visit
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}

### 就诊中完成接诊，无请求体；完成后重新查询概览和名单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/complete-visit
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorAccessToken}}
